# Run artifacts under results/ are never tracked: many carry sensitive data
# (per-cell uid.hex is the device secret, result.json/summary.json embed that
# uid, and result.json/timeseries/detection.csv carry decrypted GPS), and even
# the aggregates are large, run-specific, and re-derivable from the raw series.
# Keep the whole directory out of version control.
results/
